    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not directly for math, but I’ve used AI tools like chatbots or data analysis platforms (e.g., for economics) to clarify concepts. They’re helpful for quick explanations or breaking down complex ideas, though my low confidence in abstract reasoning means I prefer hands-on practice over relying solely on AI.",
